


```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant SCPlayer
    participant YoutubePlayerOwner
    participant NowPlayingTab
    participant store.trackToPlay
    participant App

    YoutubePlayerOwner ->> NowPlayingTab : handleEnded
    SCPlayer ->> NowPlayingTab : handleEnded
    NowPlayingTab ->> scKey : increment
    scKey ->> scKey : reload players on next render
    NowPlayingTab ->> store.trackToPlay : setTrackToPlay - load next track on next render
    store.trackToPlay ->> App : setTrack
    App ->> NowPlayingTab : Track
    alt Track.sourceType
        NowPlayingTab-->>YoutubePlayerOwner: load yt
    else Invalid credentials
        NowPlayingTab-->>SCPlayer: load sc
    end



